      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Solomoni yaaleetagho enkolagana ni kyabazinga w'e Misiri, ng'abayiza mughala wa kyabazinga oyo. Era Solomoni yaaleeta omughala oyo mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi, okutuusa lwe yamala okwezimbira endhu n'ekisaagaati kyaku ekikye, n'eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda, n'ekimante okwezungulula ekibuga Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okutuusa mu kiseera ekyo, abantu baali nga bakaagheerayo emisengo mu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, kuba ghaali nga ghakaali kuzimbwagho ndhu ya kusinzizangamu Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni yagonzanga Musengwa Katonda ng'ajiira ku ebyo lata we Daudi bye yamusikirira. Aye era Solomoni oyo, yeena yagheerangayo emisengo era yaaniokezanga obubbaani mu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
